01:48:32.590 --> 01:48:34.970
that we're making at home actually rivals

01:48:34.970 --> 01:48:36.200
the sauerkraut that you can buy

01:48:36.200 --> 01:48:39.320
out of the refrigerated
section at the grocery store.

